  "notes": "## 升级前请阅读 / Before upgrading\n\n- 从数据库谱系不兼容的旧版本跨代升级前，请备份或导出重要数据；应用沿用既有的数据集重建规则，不转换历史数据，Agent 数据清理保留非 Agent 配置。使用已退役 Computer 契约的会话需新建会话，原历史保留，个人 Agent 请重新选择 Computer 动作。\n- Back up or export important data before upgrading from an incompatible older database lineage. Existing dataset rebuild rules remain in effect without converting historical data; Agent clean cuts preserve non-Agent configuration. Retired Computer bindings require a new session and reselected actions for personal Agents; existing history is retained.\n\n## 更新内容\n\n- 键盘设置新增引导式配置：本地麦克风检测、就绪状态判断与设置自动保存；字幕键盘同步新的采集状态。\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Add a guided keyboard setup with local microphone checks, readiness detection and automatic settings save; the subtitle keyboard reflects the new capture state.\n\n## Windows 下载 / Downloads\n\n- x64 安装包 / x64 installer: `NomiFun_0.8.19_x64-setup.exe`\n- 本次首发仅提供 Windows x64；其他平台产物后续追加。\n- This initial publication provides Windows x64 only; other platform artifacts will follow.",
